{
  "_comment": [
    "Which capture belongs in which Figma frame. All 102 frames are filled; this mapping stays so a",
    "regenerated capture can be put back without redoing the layout: request one upload URL per frame",
    "(upload_assets with nodeIds, scaleMode FILL) and POST the file at `image` to it.",
    "Two things to know. The upload host mcp.figma.com is not in the default allowlist for a cloud",
    "session, so the environment needs Custom network access including *.figma.com. And the placement",
    "step only resolves target nodes on the file's first page: uploads aimed at the Modals page",
    "returned success with an imageHash but no `placedOnNodeId`, and the fills had to be set from",
    "those hashes afterwards."
  ],
